# Privacy Policy for Quran Reels Publisher

Last updated: October 2026

Quran Reels Publisher ("the App") is an automated internal utility used exclusively to manage and publish Quranic video content to the "Woman value in islam" Facebook Page.

### 1. Information We Collect
The App does not collect, store, sell, or share any personal identifiable information (PII) from Facebook users or page visitors. 

### 2. Permissions & Data Usage
The App accesses the Facebook Graph API solely to:
- Authenticate Page Access Tokens.
- Upload automated video reels and publish captions.

### 3. Third-Party Services
The App interacts with:
- Meta Graph API (publishing reels)
- Pixabay API (fetching royalty-free background videos)
- Quran.com API (fetching verse text and audio)

### 4. Contact
For any questions regarding privacy, please contact the repository maintainer through GitHub.
